# No line-ending conversion, ever.  This repo is byte-exact: fam0.seed is
# cmp'd against a rebuilt binary, .fam/.fam0 sources feed a compiler that
# hashes its output, and /bin/sh scripts break under CRLF.  Windows checkouts
# (git autocrlf=true on the GitHub runner image) would silently corrupt all of
# it without this.
* -text
